#
# Same devices and legacy #l/ip/wg tables as pc64.  Adds nativev6 (one
# Ethernet->IPv6 consumer), nativeudp6 (headers=7 UDP endpoint) and
# e73udpprobe, which runs after the scheduler starts.  No bootdir/root is
# needed: main.c hands off when plan9.ini says e73udp=1.
#
# This is a TRANSITIONAL profile: it still links IPv4, ARP, #l, #I and #W.
