# No bootfs.paq/paqfs/bootrc.  The normal O-only boot requires no filesystem
# root; legacy plan9.ini root= mounting remains optional (port/devgefs.c).
# /boot/oinit is the small inherited bootstrap harness: it opens the O
# volume and the init Space and executes the MicroPython executable stored
# in O at OID_MP_EXEC.  /boot/kbdfs is the embedded console helper.  There
# is no embedded /boot/mp and no pathname-based MicroPython exec on this
# path (docs/O-FORMAT.md 7).  /boot/ohandle and /boot/oexec remain embedded
# regression harnesses, not the loader or a normal startup program.
# This bootdir embedding is NOT the proposed native O executable loader.
